# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development.
# Never commit `.env.local`; it is already covered by .gitignore.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Optional: 3D athlete model -------------------------------------------------
# Absolute URL of a GLB model of Ahmed Said Shafik.
# Leave empty to render the built-in stylised athlete; the app then makes NO
# request for a model file. See MAINTENANCE.md §7 for orientation and scale.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ATHLETE_MODEL_URL=https://example.com/models/ahmed-shafik.glb

# --- Contact form delivery (server-side only) ----------------------------------
# The contact form stays visibly unavailable until all three are set.
# Keep these out of any NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable: they must never reach the browser.
#
# RESEND_API_KEY      Resend API key used to send the inquiry email.
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL    Inbox that receives inquiries (server-controlled).
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL  Verified Resend sender, e.g. "Portfolio <contact@example.com>".
#
# A valid submission is accepted only after Resend accepts the message; the UI
# never claims confirmed inbox delivery. Until these are set, the endpoint
# answers 503 and the form is disabled.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=
